WEBVTT

00:00:00.566 --> 00:00:03.843
<v><b>A:</b></v> I <b>love cooking</b>. <b>What</b> about <b>you</b>?

00:00:07.905 --> 00:00:09.609
<v><b>B:</b></v> I <b>like cooking, too</b>.

00:00:12.641 --> 00:00:14.507
<v><b>A:</b></v> Do you <b>like reading books</b>?

00:00:17.657 --> 00:00:20.617
<v><b>B:</b></v> <b>Yes</b>, I <b>like reading good books</b>.

00:00:24.642 --> 00:00:26.135
<v><b>A:</b></v> Do you <b>like cycling</b>?

00:00:29.165 --> 00:00:32.338
<v><b>B:</b></v> <b>Yes</b>, I <b>do</b>. I <b>love cycling</b>!

00:00:35.408 --> 00:00:36.472
<v><b>A:</b></v> Are you <b>single</b>?

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:40.895
<v><b>B:</b></v> <b>No, sorry</b>.